  "changelog": "1.0.5: Multilingual matching fixes  Eproduction notes and alias parentheses in official titles/artist columns no longer break the comparison, Arabic spelling variants (hamza forms, فEفE ة/فE are folded, and a PC regression harness now covers 38 real songs across all ten supported languages. 1.0.3: Honest offline status  Etimeouts now report the source as inactive; the anonymous session is reused for an hour; transient YouTube errors (HTTP 5xx) are retried once; a reserve client version kicks in if the pinned one is rejected; ISRC query moved last. 1.0.2: License housekeeping  Eone GPL-3.0 file, no separate packaging license. 1.0.1: The name stays English in every language. 1.0: Matching searches in the song's own script  EKorean, Chinese, Russian, Greek, Hebrew, Arabic, Hindi, Thai  Ethen English, with region-aware ranking.",
